msgid "No rule description is available for this analysis item."
msgstr "此分析子项暂无规则说明。"

msgid "{description} This is a qualitative check. Avoid the condition or review every occurrence before production."
msgstr "{description} 此项为定性检查，应避免出现该情况；投产前请逐条复核。"

msgid "{description} Values outside {lower} to {upper} are high risk. Recommended range: {recommended} to {upper}."
msgstr "{description} 低于 {lower} 或高于 {upper} 均存在较高风险。建议范围：{recommended} 至 {upper}。"

msgid "{description} Recommended value: {recommended} or less."
msgstr "{description} 建议值：不大于 {recommended}。"

msgid "{description} Values above {alarm} are high risk. Recommended value: {recommended} or less."
msgstr "{description} 高于 {alarm} 存在较高风险。建议值：不大于 {recommended}。"

msgid "{description} Recommended value: {recommended} or greater."
msgstr "{description} 建议值：不小于 {recommended}。"

msgid "{description} Values below {alarm} are high risk. Recommended value: {recommended} or greater."
msgstr "{description} 低于 {alarm} 存在较高风险。建议值：不小于 {recommended}。"

msgid "Disconnected copper trace fragments returned by the DFM service."
msgstr "检查同一网络中彼此断开的铜走线片段。"

msgid "Acute trace/copper angles that may trap acid or create weak copper."
msgstr "检查可能造成蚀刻液残留或铜箔薄弱的锐角走线和铜皮。"

msgid "Track ends that are not connected to a pad, via, or other copper."
msgstr "检查未连接到焊盘、过孔或其他铜对象的走线端点。"

msgid "Copper islands that are isolated from useful nets."
msgstr "检查未与有效网络连接的孤立铜岛。"

msgid "Vias without effective copper connectivity."
msgstr "检查未形成有效铜连接的过孔。"

msgid "Minimum copper trace width. Public HQPCB capability lists 5 mil as the lower bound for common orders."
msgstr "检查铜走线的最小线宽；常规订单公开能力下限为 5 mil。"

msgid "Minimum clearance between copper traces."
msgstr "检查不同铜走线之间的最小边到边间距。"

msgid "Minimum clearance between traces and pads."
msgstr "检查走线与焊盘之间的最小边到边间距。"

msgid "Minimum general clearance between copper pads."
msgstr "检查普通铜焊盘之间的最小边到边间距。"

msgid "Minimum edge-to-edge clearance between BGA pads."
msgstr "检查 BGA 焊盘之间的最小边到边间距。"

msgid "Minimum edge-to-edge clearance between SMD pads."
msgstr "检查 SMD 焊盘之间的最小边到边间距。"

msgid "Minimum shorter-side length of ordinary pads."
msgstr "检查常规焊盘外形较短一边的最小长度。"

msgid "Undersized elongated pads have low adhesion, which can reduce manufacturing quality and yield and may increase testing costs. Use a minimum width of at least 0.15 mm; 0.2 mm or greater is recommended."
msgstr "长条焊盘过小无附着力低，会影响生产品质良率，可能会导致测试成本上涨，建议最小宽度≥0.15mm，推荐≥0.2mm。"

msgid "Too-small through-vias can reduce production efficiency and yield and may increase cost. Use a via drill diameter of at least 0.3 mm."
msgstr "Via通孔过小会影响生产效率、品质良率，可能会导致费用上涨，建议直径≥0.3 mm。"

msgid "Minimum component PTH pad drill diameter; excludes vias and NPTH pads."
msgstr "检查器件PTH焊盘的最小插件孔径，不包含Via及NPTH焊盘孔。"

msgid "Maximum generic drill size used by the remote DFM contract."
msgstr "检查远端兼容规则使用的通用最大孔径。"

msgid "Maximum plated through-hole size."
msgstr "检查金属化通孔的最大成品孔径。"

msgid "As drill diameter decreases, usable flute length also decreases; very small drills may not penetrate a thick PCB."
msgstr "钻咀直径越小，螺纹长度越短，微小钻刀无法钻穿较厚的PCB。"

msgid "Minimum mechanical via drill."
msgstr "检查机械过孔的最小孔径。"

msgid "Minimum laser blind via drill."
msgstr "检查激光盲孔的最小孔径。"

msgid "Minimum mechanically drilled blind via."
msgstr "检查机械盲孔的最小孔径。"

msgid "Minimum laser buried via drill."
msgstr "检查激光埋孔的最小孔径。"

msgid "Minimum mechanically drilled buried via."
msgstr "检查机械埋孔的最小孔径。"

msgid "The minimum oval-slot cutter diameter is 0.4 mm. The original slot must not be narrower than 0.3 mm; use at least 0.4 mm, with 0.6 mm or greater recommended."
msgstr "椭圆槽刀径最小为0.4 mm，原始槽孔不能小于0.3 mm，建议槽宽≥0.4 mm，推荐≥0.6 mm。"

msgid "Maximum blind or buried via drill."
msgstr "检查盲孔或埋孔的最大孔径。"

msgid "Oversized slots require additional production operations, reducing efficiency and increasing cost. Keep the slot length at or below 10 mm."
msgstr "槽长过大需要增加生产工序，会影响效率和成本，建议槽长≤10 mm。"

msgid "Oversized slot widths require additional production operations, reducing efficiency and increasing cost. Keep the cutter diameter at or below 5.8 mm."
msgstr "槽宽过大需要增加生产工序，会影响效率和成本，建议直径≤5.8 mm。"

msgid "When slot length is less than twice its width, uneven forces during production can deform it. Use a slot length of at least twice the width."
msgstr "slot槽的长小于2倍宽时，生产过程由于受力不均易变形，建议槽长≥2×宽。"

msgid "Square or rectangular hole size."
msgstr "检查方孔或矩形孔较短一边的尺寸。"

msgid "Minimum annular ring for vias."
msgstr "检查过孔孔边到焊盘外缘的最小孔环宽度。"

msgid "Minimum annular ring for plated through-hole pads."
msgstr "检查金属化通孔孔边到焊盘外缘的最小孔环宽度。"

msgid "Minimum spacing between vias on the same net."
msgstr "检查相同网络过孔之间的最小孔边间距。"

msgid "Minimum spacing between vias on different nets."
msgstr "检查不同网络过孔之间的最小孔边间距。"

msgid "Insufficient hole-to-hole spacing can reduce production efficiency and quality yield. Use a minimum spacing of at least 15 mil; 17 mil or greater is recommended."
msgstr "孔间距过小会影响生产效率、品质良率，建议最小间距≥15mil，推荐≥17mil。"

msgid "Minimum spacing between blind/buried vias."
msgstr "检查盲埋孔之间的最小孔边间距。"

msgid "Outer-layer clearance from plated through-hole edge to trace."
msgstr "检查金属化通孔孔边到外层走线的最小间距。"

msgid "Inner-layer clearance from plated through-hole edge to trace."
msgstr "检查金属化通孔孔边到内层走线的最小间距。"

msgid "Outer-layer clearance from via edge to trace."
msgstr "检查过孔孔边到外层走线的最小间距。"

msgid "Inner-layer clearance from via edge to trace."
msgstr "检查过孔孔边到内层走线的最小间距。"

msgid "Clearance from non-plated hole edge to copper."
msgstr "检查非金属化孔孔边到走线、焊盘或铺铜的最小间距。"

msgid "Minimum distance from SMD pad to board edge."
msgstr "检查 SMD 焊盘到成品板边的最小距离。"

msgid "Minimum distance from trace to board edge."
msgstr "检查走线到成品板边的最小距离。"

msgid "Minimum distance from copper pour or copper feature to board edge."
msgstr "检查铺铜或其他铜特征到成品板边的最小距离。"

msgid "Right-angle corners in square or rectangular holes cannot be machined in the production process. Use a circular or oval hole instead."
msgstr "生产过程正/长方孔的直角无法加工出来，建议改为圆形或椭圆形。"

msgid "Castellated or half-hole feature detection."
msgstr "检查钻孔与成品板边相交形成的半孔特征。"

msgid "Via overlap with BGA pad."
msgstr "检查过孔与 BGA 焊盘的重叠。"

msgid "Via overlap with SMD pad."
msgstr "检查过孔与 SMD 焊盘的重叠。"

msgid "NPTH overlap with SMD pad."
msgstr "检查非金属化孔与 SMD 焊盘的重叠。"

msgid "PTH overlap with SMD pad."
msgstr "检查金属化通孔与 SMD 焊盘的重叠。"

msgid "Pad or copper feature that should expose solder mask but has no opening."
msgstr "检查应露铜但没有对应阻焊开窗的焊盘或铜特征。"

msgid "Minimum solder-mask web between separate openings."
msgstr "检查相邻独立阻焊开窗之间的最小阻焊桥宽度。"

msgid "Clearance from a mask opening to a trace on another net."
msgstr "检查阻焊开窗到其他网络走线的最小间距。"

msgid "One connected solder-mask opening exposes copper from multiple nets."
msgstr "检查一个连续阻焊开窗是否同时露出多个网络的铜。"

